  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the symbolism of growth and connection with our personalized Tree of Life Quilt Set from Jeminise. This beautiful bedding set features the ancient Yggdrasil design, perfect for adding a touch of meaningful elegance to your home while offering cozy comfort.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Amazing Yggdrasil Design:</strong> Showcases the tree of life, symbolizing resilience, strength, and interconnectedness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches) to perfectly fit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Professional Design:</strong> Crafted with specially designed colorful themes on smooth material, providing both functional warmth and decorative appeal.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An ideal and practical gift for loved ones, suitable for housewarmings, weddings, holidays, birthdays, or any special occasion.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes 1 Quilt, with an optional pillowcase available.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable; simply wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat for lasting fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from a blend of Polycotton with Cotton and Polyester fabric for comfort and durability.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton, Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Colorful Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Minimalist</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw(60x70 inches)| Twin(68x86 inches)| Full(80x90 inches)| Queen (90x90 inches)| King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
